OL,3,GNEWSAWill Scottish football finally
OL,4,Aagree on how to fix youth development?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen things go wrong in Scottish
OL,7,Ffootball, there's a running joke among
OL,8,Fsupporters about what comes next:
OL,9,FAnother think tank, another summit,
OL,10,Fanother grand plan.
OL,12,FThe cynicism is understandable.
OL,14,FFor more than 15 years, Scottish
OL,15,Ffootball has been openly and publicly
OL,16,Fasking itself what it could be doing
OL,17,Fbetter.
OL,19,FIn particular, how it can produce more
OL,20,Felite players and help the national
OL,21,Fteam not just qualify for major
OL,22,Ftournaments, but compete at them.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
